{"id":"48233b115b99f8c2","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-sigma-type.md","title":"df-sigma-type","display":"df-sigma-type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-sigma-type","aliases":["16-df-sigma-type","Sigma type"],"display":"df-sigma-type","depends_on":["[[16-df-set]]"],"source":"§10.1 p.584 (PDF604); §10.5 p.625 (PDF645), set-family sums","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-sigma-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-sigma-type</span><span>Sigma type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma-type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.1 p.584 (PDF604); §10.5 p.625 (PDF645), set-family sums"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a> 的宇宙，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U\">\\(A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:\\Gamma.A\\to\\mathcal U\">\\(B:\\Gamma.A\\to\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为小集合族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.A\">\\(\\Gamma.A\\)</span> 在下文构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{x:A}B\">\\(\\Sigma_{x:A}B\\)</span> 是本页定义的集合族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta^{-1}\">\\(\\theta^{-1}\\)</span> 是下文构造的总空间重新括号映射。函数参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\gamma,a)\">\\((\\gamma,a)\\)</span> 的简写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(\\gamma,a)\">\\(B(\\gamma,a)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_{x:A}B&amp;\\coloneqq\\left(\\gamma\\mapsto\\{(a,b)\\mid a\\in A(\\gamma)\\land b\\in B(\\gamma,a)\\}\\right)\\in\\mathcal U^\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\Gamma.(\\Sigma_{x:A}B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,(a,b))\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\land b\\in B(\\gamma,a)\\},\\\\\nZ&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a,b)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\land b\\in B(\\gamma,a)\\},\\\\\n\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq((\\gamma,(a,b))\\mapsto(\\gamma,a,b)):\\Gamma.(\\Sigma_{x:A}B)\\to Z,\\\\\n\\theta^{-1}&amp;\\coloneqq((\\gamma,a,b)\\mapsto(\\gamma,(a,b))):Z\\to\\Gamma.(\\Sigma_{x:A}B),\\\\\n\\theta^{-1}\\theta&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{\\Gamma.(\\Sigma_{x:A}B)},\\qquad\n\\theta\\theta^{-1}=\\operatorname{id}_Z.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_{x:A}B&amp;\\coloneqq\\left(\\gamma\\mapsto\\{(a,b)\\mid a\\in A(\\gamma)\\land b\\in B(\\gamma,a)\\}\\right)\\in\\mathcal U^\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\Gamma.(\\Sigma_{x:A}B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,(a,b))\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\land b\\in B(\\gamma,a)\\},\\\\\nZ&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a,b)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\land b\\in B(\\gamma,a)\\},\\\\\n\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq((\\gamma,(a,b))\\mapsto(\\gamma,a,b)):\\Gamma.(\\Sigma_{x:A}B)\\to Z,\\\\\n\\theta^{-1}&amp;\\coloneqq((\\gamma,a,b)\\mapsto(\\gamma,(a,b))):Z\\to\\Gamma.(\\Sigma_{x:A}B),\\\\\n\\theta^{-1}\\theta&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{\\Gamma.(\\Sigma_{x:A}B)},\\qquad\n\\theta\\theta^{-1}=\\operatorname{id}_Z.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§10.1 p.584（PDF604）、§10.5 p.625（PDF645）的依赖和集合族公式。小集合宇宙的依赖和闭包保证所得族仍小。类型的纤维元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span>，总空间元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\gamma,(a,b))\">\\((\\gamma,(a,b))\\)</span>；同构明确展平为三元组。本页不把未给出解释函数的括号记号当作定义，也不假定任意码集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 对和封闭。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$ 采用 [[16-df-set]] 的宇宙，$\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U$、$A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U$，$B:\\Gamma.A\\to\\mathcal U$ 为小集合族；$\\Gamma.A$ 在下文构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"B:\\Gamma.A\\to\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{x:A}B","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\gamma,a)","display":false},{"tex":"B(\\gamma,a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.A&\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_{x:A}B&\\coloneqq\\left(\\gamma\\mapsto\\{(a,b)\\mid a\\in A(\\gamma)\\land b\\in B(\\gamma,a)\\}\\right)\\in\\mathcal U^\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\Gamma.(\\Sigma_{x:A}B)&\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,(a,b))\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\land b\\in B(\\gamma,a)\\},\\\\\nZ&\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a,b)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\land b\\in B(\\gamma,a)\\},\\\\\n\\theta&\\coloneqq((\\gamma,(a,b))\\mapsto(\\gamma,a,b)):\\Gamma.(\\Sigma_{x:A}B)\\to Z,\\\\\n\\theta^{-1}&\\coloneqq((\\gamma,a,b)\\mapsto(\\gamma,(a,b))):Z\\to\\Gamma.(\\Sigma_{x:A}B),\\\\\n\\theta^{-1}\\theta&=\\operatorname{id}_{\\Gamma.(\\Sigma_{x:A}B)},\\qquad\n\\theta\\theta^{-1}=\\operatorname{id}_Z.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\gamma,(a,b))","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":1843,"backlinks":[{"id":"c7ee47bb037aa758","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\mathcal U,\\sigma,\\tau$ 满足 [[16-df-sigma-type]] 的小集合族条件，分别代入其中 $A,B$；$\\Sigma_{x:\\sigma}\\tau$ 是该页定义的族。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-330","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-sigma-type|df-sigma-type]]"}],"outgoing":["09b2ae01fb2d54e3"]}